// Telegraph — flat disc marking a scheduled mechanic's area. Client-side
// visual only: no Hitbox (no collision, no spatial grid, no AOI replication).
// Scale is set on spawn from the mechanic's radius; color fill is animated
// as a pure function of synced server time vs resolve_at (DESIGN.md §3).
(
    components: {
        "Transform":   (),
        "RenderShape": (shape: Cylinder, color: (0.45, 0.08, 0.08)),
    },
)
